  "fullDescription": "Christmas Charms 3d print file 3mp\nCreate a festive range of Christmas accessories with this set of 10 Christmas charm designs, created especially for 3D printing.\n\nThese little Christmas designs are perfect for turning into earrings, keychains, bag charms, zipper pulls, ornaments, gift accessories and other handmade products for Christmas markets, craft stalls, online stores and gifting.\nEach design has been created with simple colour sections and bold details, making them great for multicolour FDM printing.\n\nDESIGNS INCLUDED\n🎄 Christmas Tree\n🎅 Santa Hat\n⛄ Snowman\n🎀 Christmas Wreath\n🎁 Present\n❄️ Snowflake Bauble\n🍭 Candy Cane\n🧦 Christmas Stocking\n🧤 Christmas Mitten\n🔔 Christmas Bells\n\nDIGITAL FILES INCLUDED\n• 10 Christmas charm designs\n• 3MF files for easy multicolour setup\n• Clean, ready-to-print models\n• Designed for FDM 3D printing\n• Great for multicolour printers\n• Colours can easily be customised to suit your own Christmas collection\n• Instant digital download\n\nPERFECT FOR MAKING\nTurn your prints into Christmas earrings, keychains, bag charms, zipper charms, gift tags, decorations and more. Add jump rings, beads, tassels, ribbons or other findings to create your own finished products.\n\nCOMMERCIAL USE INCLUDED\nYou are welcome to sell physical items you print using these files, making them ideal for handmade businesses, Christmas markets, craft stalls and online shops.\nThe digital files themselves may not be resold, shared, redistributed or uploaded elsewhere.",
